[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429585\">7040B22</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the striker.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045174.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the striker is undamaged.</p><p>Position the striker and screw in the bolts\nwithout tightening them.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429585\">7040B22</a></p><p>1. Remove the covers.</p><p>2. Working on the bolts through the openings (2a), adjust the position\nof the striker (2b). Tighten the bolts (2c). The arrows show the\npossible movements.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>TAIL-GATE LOCK STRIKER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>Check that the tailgate opens\nand closes properly.</p>"]]